ee affected?", "format": "General", "fill": "00000000", "style": 403, "input": false}, "B19": {"v": "Unknown", "cached": "Unknown", "format": "General", "fill": "FFFFFF00", "style": 580, "input": false}, "C19": {"v": "Withdrawals may reduce guarantees or income bases depending on contract", "cached": "Withdrawals may reduce guarantees or income bases depending on contract", "format": "General", "fill": "00000000", "style": 403, "input": false}, "D19": {"v": "Get contract", "cached": "Get contract", "format": "General", "fill": "00000000", "style": 403, "input": false}, "A20": {"v": "Alternative funding source reviewed?", "cached": "Alternative funding source reviewed?", "format": "General", "fill": "00000000", "style": 403, "input": false}, "B20": {"v": "No", "cached": "No", "format": "General", "fill": "FFFFFF00", "style": 580, "input": false}, "C20": {"v": "Another account may have different tax, fee, liquidity and opportunity-cost effects", "cached": "Another account may have different tax, fee, liquidity and opportunity-cost effects", "format": "General", "fill": "00000000", "style": 403, "input": false}, "D20": {"v": "Discuss", "cached": "Discuss", "format": "General", "fill": "00000000", "style": 403, "input": false}, "A22": {"v": "Educational scope: This workbook is designed to help a client understand terminology and questions to investigate. It does not calculate an individual's legal or tax liability. Tax laws, retirement-plan rules, and annuity contracts can change and can contain exceptions; actual decisions should use current account documents and qualified tax/legal advice when appropriate.", "cached": "Educational scope: This workbook is designed to help a client understand terminology and questions to investigate. It does not calculate an individual's legal or tax liability. Tax laws, retirement-plan rules, and annuity contracts can change and can contain exceptions; actual decisions should use current account documents and qualified tax/legal advice